WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:02.340
How much salt is too much?

00:02.840 --> 00:09.240
For most adults, it's less than five grams a day. That's about one level teaspoon, for the whole day.

00:09.740 --> 00:18.820
Most salt doesn't come from the salt shaker. It hides in pickles, pappadams, chips, salted fish, instant noodles and bakery snacks.

00:19.320 --> 00:25.050
For flavour, use lemon, garlic, curry leaves and spices, instead of extra salt.

00:25.550 --> 00:31.110
Taste your food before adding salt, and keep pickle to a small spoon, not every meal.

00:31.610 --> 00:39.800
When you buy packaged food, check the label for sodium. Less than one hundred and twenty milligrams per hundred grams is low.

00:40.300 --> 00:48.130
Your taste buds adjust in two to three weeks. And cutting salt can lower your blood pressure within a few weeks.
